      "extract": "Firstly, we review a result in [5]. Let L be a knot in S3. We consider a 1-tangle L′ whose closure is L. We assume that L′ is presented as a tangle diagram D in 258 Toshie Takata generic position with respect to the height function with the end points at the top and at the bottom. We orient D from the top to the bottom. Let c denote the number of the crossings in a diagram D. There are eight crossing types given by",
